	(text "Eight 3.3 V GPIO (MCU pins). Each: 4.7k series + BAT54S clamp to +3V3/GND on the MCU side,\nso a 24 V short draws ~4.5 mA and the pin stays inside its rails. Own GND terminal per channel."
